CLAUDE.md
# Documentation build output: generated, not versioned.
docs/build/
# Autosummary generates the API .rst files from the installed packages, on every build.
docs/source/_generated/
# rustdoc, copied here by `make rustdoc` and published as a sub-path of the site.
#
# Only rustdoc. `_extra/` is `html_extra_path`, and not everything in it is a build product:
# `_extra/validation/coverage.html` is generated where the signing keys are and committed, because
# a machine without them computes every signature as invalid. Ignoring the whole directory is what
# forced Read the Docs to try to regenerate that page for itself.
docs/source/_extra/rustdoc/
# Working areas of the Jenkins pipeline (stopped, but the names stay reserved).
/reports/
/trend_data/
